{"id":"n77635-2-7","stage":4,"title":"찬란하다 · 灿烂","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77635-2-7-1","ko":"이 반지, 결혼기념일에 남편이 사 줬어.","zh":"这枚戒指是结婚纪念日时我丈夫送给我的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반지,","meaning":"戒指","explanation":"반지：戒指","readings":[{"term":"반지","audio":"/audio/f1e02439b018ae91a9e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57661","senseId":"1","lemma":"반지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼기념일에","meaning":"结婚纪念日","explanation":"결혼기념일：结婚纪念日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"결혼기념일","audio":"/audio/2061be80dd2451b571c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30402","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼기념일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남편이","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬어.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f1e02439b018ae91","term":"반지","zh":"戒指","audio":"/audio/f1e02439b018ae91a9e1.mp3","entryId":"57661","definition":"套在手指上的圆形首饰。","pronunciation":["반지"]},{"id":"2061be80dd2451b5","term":"결혼기념일","zh":"结婚纪念日","audio":"/audio/2061be80dd2451b571c8.mp3","entryId":"30402","definition":"为纪念结婚的日子，每年庆祝的那天。","pronunciation":["결혼기녀밀"]},{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/54b3bb98fb2788fa5522.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77635-2-7-2","ko":"좋았겠다. 보석 빛깔이 아주 찬란하네.","zh":"一定很棒吧。宝石的颜色非常绚丽呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋았겠다.","meaning":"那样就好了","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보석","meaning":"宝石","explanation":"보석：宝石","readings":[{"term":"보석","audio":"/audio/5e6c05318b36288b4fad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59248","senseId":"1","lemma":"보석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빛깔이","meaning":"色彩","explanation":"빛깔：色彩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빛깔","audio":"/audio/df31a65ebcb91b264331.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15827","senseId":"1","lemma":"빛깔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찬란하네.","meaning":"灿烂，绚丽","explanation":"찬란하다：灿烂，绚丽；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"찬란하다","audio":"/audio/0e06f5a0ba1d6e94bacd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77635","senseId":"2","lemma":"찬란하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"5e6c05318b36288b","term":"보석","zh":"宝石","audio":"/audio/5e6c05318b36288b4fad.mp3","entryId":"59248","definition":"一种稀有昂贵的石头。坚硬色美、发光闪耀，可用来制作项链或戒指等装饰品。","pronunciation":["보ː석"]},{"id":"df31a65ebcb91b26","term":"빛깔","zh":"色彩","audio":"/audio/df31a65ebcb91b264331.mp3","entryId":"15827","definition":"物体在光照下显现出的颜色。","pronunciation":["빋깔"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"0e06f5a0ba1d6e94","term":"찬란하다","zh":"灿烂，绚丽","audio":"/audio/0e06f5a0ba1d6e94bacd.mp3","entryId":"77635","definition":"颜色或模样等非常华丽或美丽。","pronunciation":["찰ː란하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/99ce03efb82efe431fd7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.762,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77635","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.5887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["一定很棒吧。宝石的颜色非常绚丽呢。","这枚戒指是结婚纪念日时我丈夫送给我的。","把用盐腌好的白菜拿过来吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这枚戒指是结婚纪念日时我丈夫送给我的。","把用盐腌好的白菜拿过来吧。","一定很棒吧。宝石的颜色非常绚丽呢。"],"answer":2}]}
